sequenceDiagram
  actor Browser as Person / browser
  box OCC controller owners
    participant Auth as Authentication<br/>Better Auth mechanics
    participant State as Account + State<br/>PostgreSQL unit
    participant IAM as IAM / resource API
  end
  participant GitHub as github.com
  Note over Browser,GitHub: Proposed flow · requests solid, replies dashed
  Browser->>Auth: Trusted-origin start
  Auth->>State: Reserve bound attempt, at most ten minutes
  State-->>Auth: Reservation acknowledged
  Auth-->>Browser: Authorization URL and browser binding
  Browser->>GitHub: Sign in
  GitHub-->>Browser: Exact callback with code / state
  Browser->>Auth: Bound callback
  Auth->>State: Match and atomically consume once
  alt Invalid or uncertain consumption
    State-->>Auth: No accepted consumption
    Auth-->>Browser: No exchange or session, new start
  else Consumption acknowledged
    State-->>Auth: Consumed attempt
    Note over Auth,GitHub: Remote work outside account / policy locks
    Auth->>GitHub: Bounded code exchange, then authenticated /user
    GitHub-->>Auth: Token and numeric identity
    Auth->>Auth: Verify identity, discard provider tokens
    Auth->>State: Exact instance / subject, guarded issuance
    Note over Auth,State: Recheck method, Principal, active account and currentness
    alt Unknown / disabled / stale identity
      State-->>Auth: Deny issuance
      Auth-->>Browser: No session, generic denial
    else Admitted current account
      State->>State: Insert fresh session and required facts
      alt Failed or unknown commit
        State-->>Auth: No acknowledged session
        Auth-->>Browser: No credential and no blind replay
      else Commit acknowledged
        State-->>Auth: Session and State-authoritative expiry
        Auth->>Auth: Final expiry check, derive cookie age
        Auth-->>Browser: Ordinary OCE cookie if unexpired
      end
    end
  end
  Note over Browser,IAM: Later request · only a current session proceeds
  Browser->>Auth: Console session, Namespace list, existing Agent GET
  Auth->>State: Admit current stored session
  State-->>Auth: Current account / Principal or denial
  alt Current session
    Auth->>IAM: Authorize exact requested resource
    IAM-->>Auth: Allowed result or permission denial
    Auth-->>Browser: Console result within existing grants
  else Admission denied
    Auth-->>Browser: Clear protected content, sign-in required
  end
